   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-functions-md-15",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## Concurrency: `spawn`, `yield`, `async`, `await`\n\n`spawn f(args)` starts a green task, `yield` lets other tasks run, and `await h`\nwaits for a task and returns its result. They are covered in\n[Concurrency](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/concurrency.html). In short:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-functions-8",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "fn worker() {\n    print(\"worker\")\n}\nspawn worker()\nyield\nprint(\"main\")\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
